8. Conclusion
A Progressive Web Application is a suitable solution for the college canteen food-ordering system. It allows students to browse menus, place orders, make payments, and receive order-status notifications through a convenient app-like interface. It is accessible across multiple devices and can be easier and more cost-effective to maintain than separate native applications. Proper attention must be given to payment security, internet connectivity, and order management during peak hours.
